WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Evacuate ordinary people first

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,780
Go out and meet our people.

3
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,660
Let those women listen to the rest of the alliance

4
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,220
Anyone who doesn't listen will report back to me.

5
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,500
Yes boss

6
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:08,780
He is testing

7
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,420
Are you a true-non-doubter?

8
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:17,580
You still want to send the outside information to him, right? Zhongzhong is limited. You are overweight and landed one of them. The three of them are just right.

9
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:24,890
One more person can't fly, so wait until the next flight. I don't want to help us deliberately play tricks.

10
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:27,090
I think it doesn't matter if he doesn't let his men come tomorrow.

11
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:28,610
If he wants to take it off, he can stay here with me.

12
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:31,730
If the plane doesn't come tomorrow, we'll get rid of him.

13
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:34,480
Just sent it out

14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,960
Helicopters are flying every day these days

15
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,000
The sound attracts all the zombies around
